ine);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">Spot names</div>\n        <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">The first three distinct spots, joined with commas, then an ellipsis when there are more. Built from the source (TripTemplates), so Eastern Sierra reads Fossil Falls, Alabama Hills, Lake Sabrina…; the snapshot shows an older seed (Mobius Arch).</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
